{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1000_p", "source_sha256": "325fcd36104e344d241c55b42e3c6b0a4255f1ca721fb1cc9c362a268f70e7ef", "ja": "（海美が舞台劇『茨の森と眠り姫』で王子様を演じた。\n純粋な王子の気持ちが伝わってくる名演だった……）", "zh": "（海美在舞台剧《荆棘之森与睡美人》中饰演王子。那精彩的表演传达出了王子纯真的心情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "6da88daf430eebae9e6afcf85c7879702d3f8c60f5243ac7570a6852a86cd106", "ja": "うわーん！　{$P$}！\nめちゃくちゃ緊張したよ～っ！！", "zh": "呜哇——！{$P$}！\n紧张得不得了啊～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d91960a7dcdbac654ed2b22d97885b3908fad6175d9f6f8e784ae99a2438439c", "ja": "お疲れ様、海美。そんなに緊張してたのか？\n全然平気そうに見えたけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，海美。你刚才那么紧张吗？\n不过看起来完全没事的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "7e8d25c700a1e1bcae476d681bca5eb78fd092d38f12ef322c22d02107614825", "ja": "ううん。手も足もすっごく震えてて、たぶん挙動不審に\nなってたと思う……。ううっ、もう失敗だよぉ……。", "zh": "才没有呢。手脚都抖得厉害，大概举动都变得很可疑了\n吧……呜呜，简直搞砸了啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8fc5dc947ab4d2352413e9291c242ee0643c47c25030f0d98bcb3bdc2a8d010b", "ja": "言われなければ、わからなかったよ。舞台にはちゃんと\nスマートな海美王子がいて、お客さんを魅了してたぞ。", "zh": "要不是你说，我根本看不出来。舞台上分明有个从容潇洒的海美王子，把观众都迷住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "16e44c938d4256bf51de244ecf9234d5db9880a6f519f3350a653f1c23f040da", "ja": "ホ、ホントに？　{$P$}に\nそう見えてたならよかった……。はぁ～。", "zh": "真、真的吗？要是{$P$}先生看起来也是那样就好了……呼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a3ab0206c05f25cf27bff4ee93a32a1a3e88b81774653fd02885f1abd803b61f", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだ。\nしかし、どうしてそんなに緊張したんだ？", "zh": "啊，完美。\n不过，你为什么会那么紧张？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "50115a59ce179ddf2c5f5caae9fba0888f35e261e92e84553e909cb3731f1c53", "ja": "たぶん、お客さんが入ったからかも。リハと違う\n空気で、ものすっごーくドキドキしちゃって……。", "zh": "也许是因为有客人来了吧。和排练时的气氛不一样，让我紧张得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "0fee6f774b0e958bbb39f5e80b3e30b5475c2cf9f2335e6ed481733444d292ac", "ja": "だ、だって～！\nお芝居だけど……人前でキスするんだよ～！？", "zh": "因、因为～！\n虽然是在演戏……但要在人前接吻啊～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8eec9e9f03cbf52ce8a83c58fbe37daed8e8cedb5a93686e635d0b5919981037", "ja": "それは……そうだな。\nたしかに、緊張するよな。", "zh": "那……倒也是。\n确实，会紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "3c54367932c8b14b5ead0ddc7e66f9bb35d17391b80f06a90468d9597a9c9b26", "ja": "でしょ？　あと、えれなんの寝顔がカワイイの！\nそれでドキドキして……思い出すだけで爆発しそう！", "zh": "对吧？而且艾蕾娜的睡脸超可爱的！\n光是想起来就心跳不已……感觉都快要爆炸了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2bbb1ec05c7ed4208111f885dfca1a5f9a8d187fddaea33825e9384160836b4b", "ja": "（照れるんじゃなくて、爆発するのか……）", "zh": "（不是害羞，而是要爆炸吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "e4a45b0ea43ddbe1461caa8126c520eda97674a7b83ea959cec89542afebe7a6", "ja": "いっぱいイメトレしたんだけど、お客さんがいると\nなんかもう、わけわかんなくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "我做了好多想象练习，可是一有观众在场，\n就总觉得脑子里一团乱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "c4b6b4422641cd74fff19e9531db277d6705ed5fac7a3fdc4b354c427390838f", "ja": "とりあえず落ち着かなきゃって、ベッドの周りを\n歩いたり、いろいろアドリブ入れちゃった……。", "zh": "我想着总之得先冷静下来，就绕着床走了几圈，还加了些即兴发挥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1014_p", "source_sha256": "1577cf8e3c0b4510572abd4261bf6169b7d14fb361d1cbbf559047c44ff59bf1", "ja": "そうか。キスシーンに入るまでが長いと思ったけど、\nあれは海美のアドリブだったのか。", "zh": "原来如此。我还觉得进入吻戏前的铺垫太长了，原来那是海美即兴发挥的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "5aa08b85343f2727d8065abe2899ae30fd0aea54b93bf47ac046c208dfc7ecec", "ja": "う、うん。そこ以外は、ちゃんと練習通りにできたけど\n……私、カッコ悪くなかった？", "zh": "嗯、嗯。除了那部分，其他地方都有好好按照练习来演……\n但我那样，会不会显得很逊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c81d9a7a0f010fbe1a5128f4597e543a604cad27d94411ae32216f83a244a9e4", "ja": "ああ。心配しなくても、素晴らしい王子様だったよ。\nお客さんもずっと海美を見てたからな。", "zh": "嗯。你不用担心，表现得像一位出色的王子殿下。\n因为客人们也一直在看着海美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "71f6a7bb40dfdd16da2a31080937006a69a44d6dd5bbc728950cfd5358bafbd7", "ja": "えっ？　私を？", "zh": "诶？看着我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c512caa2fc0e2de7eeb019fd8e9e033a5afbf1f70a8cd1ae5018d57b5030c8a5", "ja": "うん。カッコいいだけじゃなくて、人間味のある部分が\nより王子様を魅力的に見せたんだと思う。", "zh": "嗯。不仅帅气，更因为有人情味的部分，\n我觉得让王子显得更加富有魅力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1019_p", "source_sha256": "84de5519f8cbe4c658fb667c1e0c29030d61fb3543057a2831e1f5ae3e384167", "ja": "だからこそ、お姫様とのキスシーンは、\n見てる人全員、ドキドキしながら見守ってたよ。", "zh": "正因为如此，和公主的吻戏让所有观众都一边心跳加速，一边注视着那一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "46a5920b34d1a6872fc1d1e5d97ad915d7b8153c330ba7c00c10467ed6ba4341", "ja": "そ、そっか……。キスシーンは大事な場面だし、\n私もあんな風に素敵なキスができたらいいなーって。", "zh": "这、这样啊……吻戏是很重要的场面，\n我也想着，要是能像那样吻得那么美好就好了——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "6db9c6a05a9fa4b0b1398cc7666fa01278cd22716a0dcaecbb2bf161398bd7b4", "ja": "あ、あれ？　今、私……変なこと言った……？\nあー、今のはナシ！　聞かなかったことにして！", "zh": "啊、咦？我刚才……是不是说了奇怪的话……？\n啊——刚才那句不算！就当没听见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0314_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "34d86db4ce2e50d90eed81448d065cc62ca45587febaa57e065e044b18155cda", "ja": "ううっ、なんか恥ずかしくなってきちゃった……。\nわ、私……ちょっと走ってくるー！！　うわーん！", "zh": "呜呜，突然觉得有点不好意思起来了……\n我、我去跑一会儿——！！呜哇——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
